  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating progress on SDG6, investing in UN-Water.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UN-Water to enhance the work of the UN on water and especially the SDG6 monitoring. The funds will be used for 1) core ac tivities, 2) the Integrated Monitoring Initiative and 3) the secretariat of the 2023 UN Conference on water.</narrative>
  </description>
